        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The duplex microstructure consists of a soft FCC phase and a hard BCC or intermetallic phase.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic rolling followed by low-temperature annealing will refine the alloy's lamellar dual-phase microstructure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic rolling and annealing will activate additional deformation modes, including increased twinning and dislocation interactions.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic rolling and annealing will improve both yield strength and ductility relative to room-temperature rolling and annealing.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7514768::web::003::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed treatment uses liquid-nitrogen-temperature rolling with approximately 50% thickness reduction.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Annealing below the full recrystallization range will stabilize the refined microstructure.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treatment will produce an ultrafine-grained duplex microstructure that retains refined lamellar interfaces.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The treated microstructure will have a higher density of deformation twins.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic rolling suppresses recovery and produces a high dislocation density.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cryogenic rolling promotes active nano-twinning.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Twin and dislocation networks impede dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A two-hierarchical constraint effect contributes to the improved mechanical response of thermomechanically processed AlCoCrFeNi2.1.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "A self-generated microcrack-arresting mechanism contributes to improved mechanical response.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6353877::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
